---
description: >-
  The theme sets the ring weight of every event: bpmn.eventStrokeWidth for the
  start and intermediate events, bpmn.endEventStrokeWidth for the end event.
config:
  themeVariables:
    bpmn:
      eventStrokeWidth: 4
      endEventStrokeWidth: 8
---
bpmn-beta LR
  lane "Orders"
    start s1 "Order received"
    intermediate timer i1 "Wait a day"
    end e1 "Order closed"
  s1 --> i1
  i1 --> e1
